; rec79 [DATA] — DM-only parameter push, no PM code.
; DM 0xC028 = kernel LFO / modulation-waveform table (see rec77). Same slot,
; same layout; rec79 selects a SQUARE waveshape. Values 1.31 fixed-point:
; a run of +1.0 (0x7FFFFFFF) then a run of -1.0 (0x80000000), separated by
; single 0.0 samples at the transitions. One full cycle c028..c038 + guard.
dm:0xc028  LFO_Sqr_Table           ; table base = 0.0 (leading transition sample)
dm:0xc029  LFO_Sqr_HighRun         ; +1.0 x7 (c029..c02f, positive plateau)
dm:0xc030  LFO_Sqr_MidZero         ; 0.0  (mid-cycle transition sample)
dm:0xc031  LFO_Sqr_LowRun          ; -1.0 x7 (c031..c037, negative plateau)
dm:0xc038  LFO_Sqr_CycleEnd        ; 0.0  (one full cycle)
dm:0xc039  LFO_Sqr_GuardHigh       ; +1.0 x7 guard/overlap copy of positive plateau
dm:0xc040  LFO_Sqr_GuardEnd        ; 0.0  last active entry
dm:0xc041  LFO_Table_PadStart      ; 0.0  c041..c04c zero pad
